# Source requirement documents are not committed.
#
# The assignment PDF carries an internal classification marking, and CLAUDE.md
# requires this repository to be self-contained with no reference to any company,
# employer, or internal system. Committing it would contradict that rule in the
# one place nothing downstream would catch.
#
# Traceability is preserved without it: requirements/baseline.md cites the source
# by filename and section number for every REQ, and ASM-018 records this decision.
docs/*.pdf

# Build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/

# Test and coverage output
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
coverage*
*.trx

# Local environment
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
appsettings.*.local.json
.env
.env.*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
